            <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--fg-muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:0;">Place your room in Stripchat's Popular category, raise your stripscore, and get real viewers. See how the promotion works, pricing, and the playbook to get the most out of it.</p>
            <span style="font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg);margin-top:.875rem;">Read the full review →</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </section>

      <section id="cta" class="art-cta section">
        <div class="art-cta__orb"></div>
        <div class="art-cta__inner">
          <span class="art-cta__badge">Models &amp; Studios</span>
          <h2>Wishlist Live — Now Need More Fans to See It?</h2>
          <p>A wishlist only pays off if it's in front of fans who are already invested enough to want to give you something. If gifts are trickling in slower than you'd like, that's usually a traffic and visibility problem, not a wishlist problem. We work with independent models and studios on exactly that gap.</p>
          <div class="art-cta__actions">
            <a href="/model-promotion" class="art-cta__btn art-cta__btn--primary">Model promotion services →</a>
            <a href="/studio-traffic" class="art-cta__btn art-cta__btn--ghost">Studio traffic services →</a>
